                                                "sense_id": "1bf5fcef-b69e-3ded-aaa0-a583ea05385e",
                                                "text": "We can spread a rumor this cop was dirty. Look, Tom, we have newspaper people on the payroll, don't we?"
                                            }
                                        ]
